# twohuman.scen -- an AUTOPLAY=1 build against test/player.py at Cape Fuji
# (the second table): the lobby's ready handshake, the turns passing between
# two humans (one of the player's timing out), game over, back to the lobby.
wait 300
hold down 3
wait 20
press fire
wait 200
snap lobby
until 39 10 3600
wait 300
snap battle
until 3B 1 30000
wait 60
snap theirs
until 39 99 60000
wait 30
snap over
xram 38 8
until 39 0 2400
wait 120
snap lobby2
